  [`android.content.Context.registerReceiver`](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/Context#registerReceiver(android.content.BroadcastReceiver,%20android.content.IntentFilter))`(null,
  IntentFilter(Intent.ACTION_BATTERY_CHANGED))`를 반환합니다.
